   end

   * A window smaller than the full-screen display is laid out for: the debugger says so and uses line mode for the session
   * (the line mode is complete; the other full-screen programs of SD refuse, but the debugger is a tool for fixing a program and
   * a small window is no reason to take that away)
   if full.screen then
      call $sl_need('The debugger', LAY.WIDTH, LAY.DEPTH, need.msg, 1)
      if need.msg # '' then
         full.screen = @false
