      * Set up initial display and save screen image: the title bar, the source area, the data area and the
      * command line, in the library's styles.  (S.98 H3: only on an alternate screen; on the main screen the entry takes the screen and paints, once it is known that this stop is to be shown)
      gosub theme.in
